Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.61,0:01:35.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Fate doom and future　dark over light
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:44.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:46.50,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:51.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,錆びついた　shadow prison　姿潜めて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:56.43,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,行き場を探しては　I keep my soul in you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.43,0:01:58.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Never give up that fight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:03.77,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:06.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Don't let it claim your light rise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:11.28,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,果てなきを彷徨う　飽く無き声が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:16.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,足枷を解いて　羽ばたくの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.16,0:02:18.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,時間の狭間で召されてく魂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.41,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,たとえ全てを焼き尽くされたとし
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:26.08,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,ても　飲み込んで　しまえば
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:30.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇を振り翳して　胸に宿すアンサー
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:33.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1370,27)}闇中反転　照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1365.333,91.001)}Aren't you? 明鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\pos(1370.666,35)}Won't you make yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1720,74.668)} -> 探すの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,君を守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.81,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,そのに呼びかけるから
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:45.77,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇中宣戦　全身全霊　生きてゆく証
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:45.77,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs31\pos(1184,80)\bord1.2}climb back up unswayed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.36,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru(get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:50.73,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
